tract|Land-area noun supported; anatomical and pamphlet senses explicitly not covered. Park allocation translates faithfully, without identifying real land ownership or a current local authority decision.
welfare|General well-being and public support have distinct ordinals. Worker priorities and applying for support align; no invented eligibility rule, actual benefit rate or guaranteed approval.
drastic|Large/extreme effect distinguished from compulsory violence or sudden injury. Opening-hours reduction preserves force and shortage; Vietnamese degree matches without adding a numerical magnitude.
frequent|Often-occurring adjective rather than adverb or visiting verb. Delays and difficult journey translate accurately; repeated short intervals does not promise a fixed schedule.
irrigate|Crop/land water supply rather than drinking-water delivery. Farmer/channel example and transitive land object align; no fabricated yield guarantee or environmental recommendation.
